  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hey VRC Support Team,\n\nThe Quest3 will be available soon and again a huge leap in VR! The  hand tracking is probably very much underestimated now! Hand tracking is already available natively on the Quest2. VirtualDesktop also offers the possibility to transfer the hand tracking of the Quest to SteamVR. \n\nNow its time to bring the things together! The controllers will not be replaceable in many situations. But a large amount of users spend their time in VR chat handing out headpats or lying in front of mirrors an kuddle. It is for these very slow movements in these situations that it would be great to be able to put the controllers aside and switch to hand tracking. An absolutely cool feature that would hit like a bomb right now with the launch of Quest3 i think.",
